    "name": "Ch 21 - Contract Testing",
    "description": "Chapter 21 of the QAMadeEasy course. Request 1 loads the contract (/openapi.json); folder 2 checks every response against it automatically; folder 3 tests API versions. Run the whole collection in order; every test passes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
